@CashRegister.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5090

### Calculate change from a single transaction
POST {{CashRegister.API_HostAddress}}/api/change/calculate-single
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owed": 2.12,
  "paid": 3.00
}

### Get available currencies
GET {{CashRegister.API_HostAddress}}/api/change/currencies
Accept: application/json

### Get current config
GET {{CashRegister.API_HostAddress}}/api/config
Accept: application/json

### Update config
PUT {{CashRegister.API_HostAddress}}/api/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "randomDivisor": 5,
  "currencyCode": "EUR"
}

###
